-# The classic homepage closes by asking people to say something, in the site's
-# own voice. v2 dropped it and the page lost the only sentence that sounded like
-# a person rather than a product. The v1 version linked to "#leave-a-comment",
-# an anchor nothing defines, so this points at Discord, which is real.
%section{class: "pt-8 pb-7 border-b border-line"}
  %p{class: "text-muted max-w-[68ch]"}
    If you like this service, had a problem or suggestion, I'd really appreciate
    hearing about it!
    - if au_system?
      = link_to "The ozfortress Discord", "https://discord.gg/7E6kC2H", target: "_blank"
    - else
      = link_to "Our Discord", "https://discord.gg/0s38RdItLiCmARMm", target: "_blank"
    is the place to leave a message, and bugs can go on
    = succeed "." do
      = link_to "GitHub", "https://github.com/Arie/serveme/issues", target: "_blank"
